@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin / Teknisi" as User
boundary "Halaman\nBandwidth Profile" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Profiles" as DB
participant "MikroTik\nRouter" as MT

== Tambah Bandwidth Profile & Sync ==

User -> UI : Input data\n(Nama, Upload, Download, Harga)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/bandwidth-profiles
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi format data
System -> DB : INSERT bandwidth_profiles
activate DB
DB --> System : profile_id
deactivate DB

System -> DB : Cek ketersediaan router target
activate DB
DB --> System : Data router
deactivate DB

System -> MT : Buat PPP Profile di router\n(name, rate-limit)
activate MT

alt Router Online & Berhasil Sync
    MT --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = synced
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Tersimpan & tersinkronisasi
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Profil ditambahkan ke router
    deactivate UI

else Router Offline
    MT --> System : Error: Timeout
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = pending_sync
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Warning: Gagal sync ke router
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Data tersimpan, status pending
    deactivate UI
end

== Ubah Bandwidth Profile & Sync ==

User -> UI : Edit kecepatan & klik Simpan
activate UI
UI -> System : PUT /api/bandwidth-profiles/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : UPDATE bandwidth_profiles
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System -> MT : Update PPP Profile di router
activate MT

alt Router Online & Berhasil Sync
    MT --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = synced
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Profil diperbarui
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Profil router & DB diperbarui
    deactivate UI
else Router Offline
    MT --> System : Error: Timeout
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = pending_sync
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Warning: DB diperbarui,\ngagal sync
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tersimpan, sync tertunda
    deactivate UI
end

== Hapus Bandwidth Profile ==

User -> UI : Klik Hapus pada profil
activate UI
UI -> System : DELETE /api/bandwidth-profiles/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Cek penggunaan\ndi tabel subscriptions
activate DB
DB --> System : Jumlah penggunaan
deactivate DB

alt Masih Digunakan
    System --> UI : Error: Profil sedang\ndigunakan pelanggan
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Pindahkan pelanggan\nke profil lain
    deactivate UI
else Aman untuk Dihapus
    System -> MT : Hapus PPP Profile dari router
    activate MT
    MT --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : DELETE bandwidth_profiles
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Profil berhasil dihapus
    deactivate UI
end

note right of User
  Bandwidth Profile = PPP Profile
  di MikroTik.
  Setiap perubahan harus di-sync.
  Jika router offline: pending_sync.
  Hapus hanya jika tidak dipakai.
end note

@enduml